<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 18/21.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 18/21.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on</p>
<p>Firday set the following currency fixings for July 21. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   21.07.97	  18.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6860	    6.6830</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2306	    2.2262</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.4030	    4.3950</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4578	    3.4468</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5135	    0.5115</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7546	    0.7544</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2789	    0.2784</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9469	    6.9378</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6910	    0.6907</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1315	    1.1470</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
